OL,3,GNEWSAIsland could protect 30% of waters
OL,4,Ain marine plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn island could protect 30% of its
OL,7,Fwaters under plans aimed at
OL,8,Fsafeguarding marine life.
OL,10,FThe proposal would see about 50 sq
OL,11,Fmiles (128.8 sq km) of sea around Sark
OL,12,Fin the Channel Islands receive
OL,13,Fadditional protection under plans
OL,14,Fdeveloped by the island's agriculture,
OL,15,Fenvironment and sea fisheries committee
OL,16,Fwith support from the Blue Marine
OL,17,FFoundation, local fishermen and marine
OL,18,Fexperts.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
