OL,3,GNEWSAIsland could protect 30% of waters
OL,4,Ain marine plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FFreddie Watson, Channel Islands project
OL,7,Fmanager at Blue Marine Foundation, said
OL,8,Fmarine protection could help safeguard
OL,9,Fsensitive habitats while supporting
OL,10,Fsustainable fishing.
OL,12,FThe proposal has to be submitted by the
OL,13,Fcommittee to governing body Chief Pleas
OL,14,Ffor approval.
